  "description": "meme-id: live-your-life-meme; hasOverallIntent: inspirational; overall-intent-description: The image features a smiling older man in a formal suit, with the text 'live your life every moment' overlaid. The scene is posed and celebratory, suggesting a motivational or inspirational message. There is no toxicity present; the meme does not target any specific group or individual with harmful, hateful, abusive, or propagandistic intent. The intent is to encourage viewers to embrace life and make the most of each moment, using the image of a dignified, happy individual as a positive visual anchor for the message. The analogical mapping is straightforward: the joyful expression and confident posture of the man are juxtaposed with the uplifting text to reinforce the idea of living fully.",
